note Linux per-user installer. git is a read-only source-verification oracle, never a runtime dependency of installed Hop.
note SOURCE_HEAD is written by the build driver from git, not typed. All checks precede filesystem publication.
note /usr/bin/env is a desktop-launch adapter: GLib mischecks literal percent signs in executable paths before field-code expansion. No shell is used.
note Existing versions and dated launcher/desktop backups are retained; no service, timer or system directory is changed.
text hi_git "/usr/bin/git"
text hi_homekey "HOME="
text hi_datakey "XDG_DATA_HOME="
text hi_storekey "HOP_GIT_STORE="
text hi_storesuffix "/git/hop.git"
